            <p>James was spending <strong>KES 30,000 per month on Facebook ads</strong>. He was getting some leads, but the cost per acquisition was high, and the results were inconsistent. He was looking for a better way to attract customers.</p>
            <p>He had heard about SEO but assumed it was too expensive. "I always thought SEO was for big companies with big budgets," James said. "I'm a small business. I can't afford to spend KES 100,000+ per month on something that might not work."</p>
